== Phonology ==

=== Consonants ===
Compared to other Tuu languages like [[Taa language|Taa]], ǀXam has a more restricted inventory of consonants particularly the clicks, where there are only 8 series of click accompaniments, far fewer than East ǃXoon Taa's 18.<ref name=":0">{{Cite book |url=https://books.google.com/books?id=QvpwwRLYai0C|title=The Khoesan Languages |editor-last=Vossen |editor-first=Rainer |year=2013 |publisher=Psychology Press |isbn=9780700712892 |page=210 |language=en}}</ref> A preliminary consonant inventory of ǀXam, including egressive stops, fricatives, and affricates as well as ingressive clicks, is listed below.
